<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-BANGLADESH MAKE 130 IN ASIA CUP V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BANGLADESH MAKE 130 IN ASIA CUP V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh scored 130 for eight wickets off 43 overs against India before their innings was cut short by five overs due to heavy rain.</p>
<p>Their Asia Cup match had earlier been reduced to 48 overs a side from 50 after overnight rain delayed the start of play.</p>
</text>
